      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Hot Dog bag, unveiled during CELINE's Summer 2026 runway show, has officially landed on the maison's website this week. Its signature design features a rounded, fluid silhouette reminiscent of a hot dog 🌭, complete with a semi-circular metal twist lock and leather streamers on the sides that add a sense of movement. The clean lines exude an elegant yet effortless French aesthetic.",
