    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The semi-circular metal twist lock echoes the iconic design of the 16 Bag, with the Triomphe insignia and CELINE PARIS lettering engraved on either side—a subtle nod to the house's heritage. The top-opening closure allows for easy, one-handed access, and even when left naturally ajar like on the runway, your belongings stay secure.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Zoom in for an ultra-crisp visual experience.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The leather shoulder strap features an interior slider to adjust its length, allowing for hand-carry, shoulder, or crossbody styling. Inside, the bag offers two compartments plus a zip pocket, available in Small (29.5x13x3.5 cm) and Large (41x16x8 cm) sizes.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
