    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Small Hot Dog also comes in a canvas version featuring the C Sulky carriage emblem. The red canvas with tan leather trim evokes a vintage collegiate vibe. The CELINE Sulky emblem, introduced in 1966 and designed by founder Celine Vipiana, draws inspiration from the American Sulky—a two-wheeled carriage—and stands as one of the brand's earliest iconic motifs.",
